Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.48,0:00:03.16,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Ten games in a row.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N连赢{\fs78}10{\fs68}局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.58,0:00:04.76,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}One game dropped.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N整场只丢{\fs78}1{\fs68}局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.98,0:00:08.64,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a performance from Katerina Siniakova here in Osaka.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N西尼亚科娃在大阪的表现太出色了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.94,0:00:11.17,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}25{\fs68}日中午
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.17,0:00:13.03,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}大阪站女单决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.03,0:00:14.11,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}{\fs78}2016{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.11,0:00:17.05,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}她在这项赛事的东京决赛落败
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.05,0:00:19.82,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}{\fs78}10{\fs68}年后 西尼亚科娃只丢一局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.82,0:00:21.44,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}拿下冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.94,0:00:23.94,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}首轮 她先赢{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.94,0:00:26.04,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}第二盘却一局没拿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.04,0:00:28.71,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}决胜盘{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}时 斯特恩斯退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.71,0:00:30.82,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}西尼亚科娃晋级
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.35,0:00:33.79,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And Peyton Stearns looking towards David Witt.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N斯特恩斯望向大卫 维特
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.27,0:00:37.07,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}You just wonder if this match might be over.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N让人觉得 比赛可能要结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.99,0:00:40.95,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Coming to the net and conceding,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她来到网前 选择退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.95,0:00:44.01,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}with an injury to her right leg, I think.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我想 应该是右腿伤势所致
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.64,0:00:46.49,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}从第二轮到半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.49,0:00:48.29,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}她先后击败林内特
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.29,0:00:50.37,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}斯托亚纳和布尔特
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.37,0:00:52.87,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}{\fs78}3{\fs68}场比赛 {\fs78}6{\fs68}盘全赢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.87,0:00:55.75,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}再往前一步 就是冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.66,0:01:04.32,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, it ends on a fluke.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N哦 比赛以一个幸运球结束
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.58,0:01:06.28,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She has had the run of the ball today,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N今天她的球运一直不错
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.52,0:01:10.80,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but even so, Siniakova sails through.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但无论如何 西尼亚科娃顺利晋级
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.40,0:01:25.95,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}半决赛最后一分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.95,0:01:28.12,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}西尼亚科娃发球后回到底线
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.12,0:01:30.06,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}和布尔特继续相持
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.06,0:01:33.37,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}赢下这一分 她就能再进决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.72,0:01:44.72,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And that's it.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.72,0:01:47.70,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The roar tells you everything you need to know.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一声吼 已经说明了一切
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.62,0:01:55.08,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Katerina Siniakova into her second Japan Open final,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她第{\fs78}2{\fs68}次打进日本公开赛决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.24,0:01:56.88,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}her first here in Osaka.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N也是她首次在大阪打进决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.28,0:01:57.95,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.95,0:02:01.32,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}对面是{\fs78}2023{\fs68}年的大阪冠军克鲁格
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.32,0:02:04.01,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}盘点上 西尼亚科娃向右跨步
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.01,0:02:06.77,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}正手接发 再回到底线相持
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.77,0:02:09.28,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68} 首盘到手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.98,0:02:24.16,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a set of tennis that was from Katerina Siniakova.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N西尼亚科娃这一盘打得太出色了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.34,0:02:25.64,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Disappointing for Ashlyn Krueger.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N克鲁格这边令人失望
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.98,0:02:43.72,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And there it is!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛结束了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.84,0:02:46.72,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Your 2026 Japan Open champion,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N{\fs78}2026{\fs68}年日本公开赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.34,0:02:49.18,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}dominating from start to finish{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N从头到尾掌控比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.18,0:02:51.42,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}to win her sixth career title,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N拿下生涯第{\fs78}6{\fs68}座冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.22,0:02:53.92,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Katerina Siniakova.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N西尼亚科娃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.86,0:02:56.54,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Ten games in a row.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N连赢{\fs78}10{\fs68}局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.96,0:02:58.14,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}One game dropped.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N整场只丢{\fs78}1{\fs68}局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.36,0:03:02.02,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a performance from Katerina Siniakova here in Osaka.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N西尼亚科娃在大阪的表现太出色了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.38,0:03:04.24,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And now we see the smile.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N现在 她露出了笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.60,0:03:05.42,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Thoroughly deserved.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N实至名归
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.70,0:03:06.76,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a performance.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N太精彩了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.18,0:03:08.83,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}制胜分{\fs78}16{\fs68}比{\fs78}10{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.83,0:03:11.56,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}非受迫失误{\fs78}19{\fs68}比{\fs78}34{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.56,0:03:14.16,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}西尼亚科娃在对手{\fs78}7{\fs68}个发球局里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.16,0:03:15.84,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}完成{\fs78}6{\fs68}次破发
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.84,0:03:18.91,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}她把优势 一直兑现到了最后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.18,0:03:22.48,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}从东京的亚军 到大阪的冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.48,0:03:24.55,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}双打世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}西尼亚科娃
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.55,0:03:27.82,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}拿下生涯第六座巡回赛单打冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.82,0:03:30.26,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}你对她的印象 更多来自单打
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.26,0:03:31.97,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}还是双打？
